    "Dua al-Mubaahalah\nFifth: It is recommended to say Dua al-Mubahalah, which is similar to the famous supplicatory prayer known as Dua al-Baha’ that is said at the last hours of Ramazan nights (i.e. sahar). Nevertheless, a little difference in this supplication is noticed between the version of Shaykh al-Tusi and the version of Sayyid Ibn Taaoos. I will thus choose the earlier one that is recorded in Shaykh al-Tusi’s book of Misbah al-Mutahajjid and reported from Imam Ja’far al-Sadiq (a.s.):\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ بِهَآئِكَ بِاَبْهَاهُ وَ کُلُّ بَهَآئِكَ بَہِیٌّ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN BAHAAA-EKA BE-ABHAAHO WA KULLO BAHAAA-EKA BAHIYYUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most radiant of Your radiance, and all of Your radiance is radiant. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِبَهَآئِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-BAHAAA-EKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your radiance.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ جَلَالِكَ بِاَجَلِّہٖ وَ کُلُّ جَلَالِكَ جَلِیْلٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN JALAALEKA BE-AJALLEHI WA KULLO JALAALEKA JALEELUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most majestic of Your majesty, and all of Your majesty is majestic. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِجَلاَلِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-JALAALEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your majesty.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ جَمَالِكَ بِاَجْمَلِہٖ وَ کُلُّ جَمَالِكَ جَمِیْلٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN JAMAALEKA BE-AJMALEHI WA KULLO JAMAALEKA JAMEELUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most beautiful of Your beauty, and all of Your beauty is beautiful. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِجَمَالِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEJAMAALEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your beauty.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ عَظَمَتِكَ بِاَعْظَمِهَا وَ کُلُّ عَظَمَتِكَ عَظِیْمَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN A'ZAMATEKA BE-AA'ZAMEHAA WA KULLO A'ZAMATEKA A'ZEEMATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the greatest of Your greatness, and all of Your greatness is great. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِعَظَمَتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-A'ZAMATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your greatness.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ نُوْرِكَ بِاَنْوَرِہٖ وَ کُلُّ نُوْرِكَ نَیِّرٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN NOOREKA BE-ANWAREHI WA KULLO NOOREKA NAYYERUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the brightest of Your light, and all of Your light is luminous. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِنُوْرِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-NOOREKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your light.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ رَحْمَتِكَ بِاَوْسَعِهَا وَ کُلُّ رَحْمَتِكَ وَاسِعَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN RAHMATEKA BE-AWSA-E'HAA WA KULLO RAHMATEKA WAASE-A'TUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the vastest of Your mercy, and all of Your mercy is vast. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِرَحْمَتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-RAHMATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ كَمَالِكَ بِاَكْمَلِہٖ وَ کُلُّ كَمَالِكَ كَامِلٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN KAMAALEKA BE-AKMALEHI WA KULLO KAMAALEKA KAAMELUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most perfect of Your perfection, and all of Your perfection is perfect. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسئَلُكَ بِكَمَالِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-KAMAALEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your perfection.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ كَلِمَاتِكَ بِاَتَمِّهَا وَ کُلُّ كَلِمَاتِكَ تَآمَّۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN KALEMAATEKA BE-ATAMMEHAA WA KULLO KALEMAATEKA TAAAM-MATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most complete of Your words, and all of Your words are complete. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِكَلِمَاتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEKALEMAATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your words.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ اَسْمَآئِكَ بِاَكْبَرِهَا وَ کُلُّ اَسْمَآئِكَ كَبِیْرَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN ASMAAA-EKA BEAKBAREHAA WA KULLO ASMAAA-EKA KABEERATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the greatest of Your names, and all of Your names are great. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِاَسْمَآئِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-ASMAAA-EKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your names.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ عِزَّتِكَ بِاَعَزِّهَا وَ کُلُّ عِزَّتِكَ عَزِیْزَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN I'ZZATEKA BE-A-A'ZZEHAA WA KULLO I'ZZATEKA A'ZEEZATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the mightiest of Your might, and all of Your might is mighty. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِعِزَّتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-I'ZZATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your might.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ مَشِیَّتِكَ بِاَمْضَاهَا وَ کُلُّ مَشِیَّتِكَ مَاضِیَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN MASHIYYATEKA BE-AMZAAHAA WA KULLO MASHIYYATEKA MAAZEYATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most effective of Your will, and all of Your will is effective. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِمَشِیَّتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-MASHIYYATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your will.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِقُدْرَتِكَ الَّتِیْ اسْتَطَلْتَ بِهَا عَلٰی کُلِّ شَیْءٍ وَ کُلُّ قُدْرَتِكَ مُسْتَطِیْلَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-QUDRATEKAL LATIS TATALTA BEHAA A'LAA KULLE SHAY-IN WA KULLO QUDRATEKA MUSTATEELATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by Your power through which You have dominion over all things, and all of Your power is all-encompassing. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِقُدْرَتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEQUDRATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your power.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ عِلْمِكَ بِاَنْفَذِہٖ وَ کُلُّ عِلْمِكَ نَافِذٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN I'LMEKA BE-ANFAZEHI WA KULLO I'LMEKA NAAFEZUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most penetrating of Your knowledge, and all of Your knowledge is penetrating. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِعِلْمِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-I'LMEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your knowledge.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ قَوْلِكَ بِاَرْضَاهُ وَ کُلُّ قَوْلِكَ رَضِیٌّ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN QAWLEKA BE-ARZAAHO WA KULLO QAWLEKA RAZIYYUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most pleasing of Your speech, and all of Your speech is pleasing. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِقَوْلِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN BE-QAWLEKA KULLEHI\nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your speech.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ مَسَآئِلِكَ بِاَحَبِّهَا وَ کُلُّهَا اِلَیْكَ حَبِیْبٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN MASAAA-ELEKA BE-AHABBEHAA WA KULLO ELAYKA HABEEBUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most beloved of the things asked from You, and all of them are beloved to You. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِمَسَآئِلِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-MASAAA-ELEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all that is asked from You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ شَرَفِكَ بِاَشْرَفِہٖ وَ کُلُّ شَرَفِكَ شَرِیْفٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN SHARAFEKA BE-ASHRAFEHI WA KULLO SHARAFEKA SHAREEFUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the noblest of Your honor, and all of Your honor is noble. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِشَرَفِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-SHARAFEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, indeed I ask You by all of Your honor.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ سُلْطَانِكَ بِاَدْوَمِہٖ وَ کُلُّ سُلْطَانِكَ دَآئِمٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN SULTAANEKA BE-ADWAMEHI WA KULLO SULTAANEKA DAAA-EMUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most enduring of Your authority, and all of Your authority is everlasting. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِسُلْطَانِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-SULTAANEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your authority.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ مُلْکِكَ بِاَفْخَرِہٖ وَ کُلُّ مُلْکِكَ فَاخِرٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN MULKEKA BE-AFKHAREHI WA KULLO MULKEKA FAAKHERUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most splendid of Your kingdom, and all of Your kingdom is splendid. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِمُلْکِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-MULKEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your kingdom.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّی اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ عَلَآئِكَ بِاَعْلَاهُ وَ کُلُّ عَلَآئِكَ عَالٍ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN A'LAAA-EKA BE-A-A'LAAHO WA KULLO A'LAAA-EKA A'ALIN \nO Allah, I ask You by the loftiest of Your exaltedness, and all of Your exaltedness is exalted. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِعَلَآئِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-A'LAAA-EKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your exaltedness.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ آیَاتِكَ بِاَعْجَبِهَا وَ کُلُّ آیَاتِكَ عَجِیْبَۃٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN AAAYAATEKA BE-AA'JABEHAA WA KULLO AAAYAATEKA  A'JEEBATUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most wondrous of Your signs, and all of Your signs are wondrous. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِآیَاتِكَ کُلِّهَا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-AAA-YAATEKA KULLEHAA \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your signs.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ مَنِّكَ بِاَقْدَمِہٖ وَ کُلُّ مَنِّكَ قَدِیْمٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN MANNEKA BE-AQDAMEHI WA KULLO MANNEKA QADEEMUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most ancient of Your favors, and all of Your favors are ancient. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِمَنِّكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-MANNEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your favors.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِمَا اَنْتَ فِیْہِ مِنَ الشُّئُوْنِ وَ الْجَبَرُوْتِ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEMAA ANTA FEEHE MENASH SHO-OONE WAL JABAROOTE \nO Allah, I ask You by that majesty and omnipotence which belong to You. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِکُلِّ شَاْنٍ وَ کُلِّ جَبَرُوْتٍ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEKULLE SHAANIN WA KULLE JABAROOTIN \nO Allah, I ask You by every affair and every omnipotence.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِمَا تُجِیْبُنِیْ بِہٖ حِیْنَ اَسْئَلُكَ یَا اَﷲُ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEMAA TOJEEBONEE BEHI HEENA AS-ALOKA YAA ALLAAHO \nO Allah, I ask You by that through which You answer me when I ask You: O Allah! \nیَا لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ اَسْئَلُكَ بِبَهَآءِ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \nYAA LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA AS-ALOKA BE-BAHAAA-E LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA \nO there is no god except You! I ask You by the radiance of ‘There is no god except You.’ \nیَا لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ اَسْئَلُكَ بِجَلَالِ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \nYAA LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA AS-ALOKA BE-JALAALE LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA \nO there is no god except You! I ask You by the majesty of ‘There is no god except You.’ \nیَا لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ اَسْئَلُكَ بِلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \nYAA LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA AS-ALOKA BE-LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA \nO there is no god except You! I ask You by ‘There is no god except You.’\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ رِزْقِكَ بِاَعَمِّہٖ وَ کُلُّ رِزْقِكَ عَآمٌّ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN RIZQEKA BE-A-A'MMEHI WA KULLO RIZQEKA A'AAM-MUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most comprehensive of Your sustenance, and all of Your sustenance is comprehensive. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِرِزْقِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-RIZQEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your sustenance.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ عَطَآئِكَ بِاَهْنَاهُ وَ کُلُّ عَطَآئِكَ هَنِیْٓءٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN A'TAAA-EKA BE-AHNAAHO WA KULLO A'TAAA-EKA HANEEE-UN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most pleasant of Your gifts, and all of Your gifts are pleasant. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِعَطَآئِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-A'TAAA-EKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your gifts.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ خَیْرِكَ بِاَعْجَلِہٖ وَ کُلُّ خَیْرِكَ عَاجِلٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA MIN KHAYREKA BE-A-A'JALEHI WA KULLO KHAYREKA A'AJELUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the swiftest of Your goodness, and all of Your goodness is swift. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِخَیْرِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-KHAYREKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your goodness.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ بِاَفْضَلِہٖ وَ کُلُّ فَضْلِكَ فَاضِلٌ \nALLAAHUMMA INEE AS-ALOKA MIN FAZLEKA BE-AFZALEHI WA KULLO FAZLEKA FAAZELUN \nO Allah, I ask You by the most excellent of Your bounty, and all of Your bounty is excellent. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِفَضْلِكَ کُلِّہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BE-FAZLEKA KULLEHI \nO Allah, I ask You by all of Your bounty.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَدْعُوْكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ فَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AD-O'OKA KAMAA AMARTANEE FAS-TAJIB LEE KAMAA WA-A'DTANEE \nO Allah, I call upon You as You commanded me, so answer me as You promised me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ ابْعَثْنِیْ عَلَی الْاِیْمَانِ بِكَ وَ التَّصْدِیْقِ بِرَسُوْلِكَ عَلَیْہِ وَ آلِہِ السَّلَامُ \nWAB A'SNEE A'LAL EEMAANE BEKA WAT TASDEEKE BE-RASOOLEKA A'LAYHE WA AALEHIS SALAAMO \nand resurrect me upon faith in You, belief in Your Messenger — peace be upon him and his family — \nوَ الْوِلَایَۃِ لِعَلِیِّ بْنِ اَبِیْ طَالِبٍ وَ الْبَرَآئَۃِ مِنْ عَدُوِّہٖ \nWAL WELAAYATE LE-A'LIYYIB NE ABEE TAALEBIN WAL BARAAA-ATE MIN A'DUWWEHI \nloyalty to Ali ibn Abi Talib, dissociation from his enemies, \nوَ الْاِیْتِمَامِ بِالْاَئِمَّۃِ مِنْ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَیْہِمُ السَّلَامُ \nWAL EETEMAAME BIL-A-IMMATE MIN AALE MOHAMMADIN A'LAYHEMUS SALAAMO \nand adherence to the Imams from the family of Muhammad, peace be upon them; \nفَاِنِّیْ قَدْ رَضِیْتُ بِذَالِكَ یَا رَبِّ \nFA-INNEE QAD RAZEETO BE-ZAALEKA YAA RABBE \nfor indeed I am pleased with that, O my Lord.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ عَبْدِكَ وَ رَسُوْلِكَ فِیْ الْاَوَّلِیْنَ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADIN A'BDEKA WA RASOOLEKA FIL AWWALEENA \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad, Your servant and Messenger, among the former peoples, \nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ فِی الْآخِرِیْنَ \nWA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADIN FIL AAKHEREENA \nand send blessings upon Muhammad among the later peoples, \nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ فِی الْمَلَاءِ الْاَعْلٰی \nWA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADIN FIL MA-LAA-IL A-A'LAA \nand send blessings upon Muhammad in the highest assembly, \nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ فِی الْمُرْسَلِیْنَ \nWA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADIN FIL MURSALEENA \nand send blessings upon Muhammad among the messengers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعْطِ مُحَمَّدًاۨالْوَسِیْلَۃَ \nALLAAHUMMA A-A'TE MOHAMMADENIL WASEELATA \nO Allah, grant Muhammad the highest station, \nوَ الشَّرَفَ وَ الْفَضِیْلَۃَ وَ الدَّرَجَۃَ الْكَبِیْرَۃَ \nWASH SHARAFA WAL FAZEELATA WAD DARAJATAL KABEERATA \nhonor, excellence, and the greatest rank.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ قَنِّعْنِیْ بِمَا رَزَقْتَنِیْ وَ بَارِكْ لِیْ فِیْمَا اٰتَیْتَنِیْ \nWA QANNE'NEE BEMAA RAZAQTANEE WA BAARIK LEE FEEMAA AATAYTANEE \nmake me content with what You have provided for me, bless me in what You have given me, \nوَ احْفَظْنِیْ فِیْ غَیْبَتِیْ وَ فِیْ کُلِّ غَآئِبٍ هُوَ لِیْ \nWAH FAZNEE FEE GHAYBATEE WA FEE KULLE GHAAA-EBIN HOWA LEE \nand protect me in my absence and in everything absent from me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ ابْعَثْنِیْ عَلَی الْاِیْمَانِ بِكَ وَ التَّصْدِیْقِ بِرَسُوْلِكَ \nWAB A'SNEE A'LAL EEMAANE BEKA WAT TASDEEQE BERASOOLEKA \nand resurrect me upon faith in You and belief in Your Messenger.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ اَسْئَلُكَ خَیْرَالْخَیْرِ رِضْوَانَكَ وَ الْجَنَّۃَ \nWA AS-ALOKA KHAYRAL KHAYRE RIZWAANAKA WAL JANNATA \nand I ask You for the best of all good: Your pleasure and Paradise; \nوَ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ الشَّرِّ سَخَطِكَ وَ النَّارِ \nWA A-O'OZO BEKA MIN SHARRISH SHARRE SAKHATEKA WAN NAARE \nand I seek refuge in You from the worst of all evil: Your wrath and the Fire.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ احْفَظْنِیْ مِنْ کُلِّ مُصِیْبَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ بَلِیَّۃٍ \nWAH FAZNEE MIN KULLE MOSEEBATIN WA MIN KULLE BALIYYATIN \nand protect me from every calamity, every affliction, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ عُقُوْبَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ فِتْنَۃٍ \nWA MIN KULLE O'QOOBATIN WA MIN KULLE FITNATIN \nevery punishment, every trial, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ بَلَآءٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ شَرٍّ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ مَكْرُوْہٍ \nWA MIN KULLE BALAAA-IN WA MIN KULLE SHARRIN WA MIN KULLE MAKROOHIN \nevery tribulation, every evil, every hateful thing, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ مُصِیْبَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ آفَۃٍ نَزَلَتْ \nWA MIN KULLE MOSEEBATIN WA MIN KULLE AAAFATIN NAZALAT \nevery disaster, and every harm descending \nاَوْ تَنْزِلُ مِنَ السَّمَآءِ اِلَی الْاَرْضِ فِیْ هٰذِہِ السَّاعَۃِ \nAW TANZELO MENAS SAMAAA-E ELAL ARZE FEE HAAZEHIS SAA-A'TE \nor about to descend from the heaven to the earth in this hour, \nوَ فِیْ هٰذِہِ اللَّیْلَۃِ وَ فِیْ هٰذَا الْیَوْمِ \nWA FEE HAAZEHIL LAYLATE WA FEE HAAZAL YAWME \nthis night, this day, \nوَ فِیْ هٰذَا الشَّہْرِ وَ فِیْ هٰذِہِ السَّنَۃِ \nWA FEE HAAZASH SHAHRE WA FEE HAAZEHIS SANATE \nthis month, and this year.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ اقْسِمْ لِیْ مِنْ کُلِّ سُرُوْرٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ بَہْجَۃٍ \nWAQ SIM LEE MIN KULLE SOROORIN WA MIN KULLE BAHJATIN \nand allot for me from every joy, delight, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ اسْتِقَامَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ فَرَجٍ \nWA MIN KULLIS TEQAAMATIN WA MIN KULLE FARAJIN \nuprightness, relief, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ عَافِیَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ سَلَامَۃٍ \nWA MIN KULLE A'AFEYATIN WA MIN KULLE SALAAMATIN \nwellbeing, safety, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ كَرَامَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ رِزْقٍ وَاسِعٍ حَلَالٍ طَیِّبٍ \nWA MIN KULLE KARAAMATIN WA MIN KULLE RIZQIN WAASE-I'N HALAALIN TAYYEBIN \nhonor, lawful and wholesome abundant sustenance, \nوَ مِنْ کُلِّ نِعْمَۃٍ وَ مِنْ کُلِّ سَعَۃٍ \nWA MIN KULLE NE'MATIN WA MIN KULLE SA-A'TIN \nblessing, and ease \nنَزَلَتْ اَوْ تَنْزِلُ مِنَ السَّمَآءِ اِلَی الْاَرْضِ \nNAZALAT AW TANZELO MENAS SAMAAA-E ELAL ARZE \ndescending or about to descend from the heaven to the earth \nفِیْ هٰذِہِ السَّاعَۃِ وَ فِیْ هٰذِہِ اللَّیْلَۃِ \nFEE HAAZEHIS SAA-A'TE WA FEE HAAZEHIL LAYLATE \nin this hour, this night, \nوَ فِیْ هٰذَا الْیَوْمِ وَ فِیْ هٰذَا الشَّہْرِ وَ فِیْ هٰذِہِ السَّنَۃِ \nWA FEE HAAZAL YAWME WA FEE HAAZASH SHAHRE WA FEE HAAZEHIS SANATE \nthis day, this month, and this year.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنْ كَانَتْ ذُنُوْبِیْ قَدْ اَخْلَقَتْ وَجْہِیْ \nALLAAHUMMA IN KAANAT ZONOOBEE QAD AKHLAQAT WAJHEE\nO Allah, if my sins have worn away my honor \nعِنْدَكَ وَ حَالَتْ بَیْنِیْ وَ بَیْنَكَ \nI'NDAKA WA HAALAT BAYNEE WA BAYNAKA \nbefore You, come between me and You, \nوَ غَیَّرَتْ حَالِیْ عِنْدَكَ \nWA GHAYYARAT HAALEE I'NDAKA \nand changed my state before You, \nفَاِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِنُوْرِ وَجْہِكَ الَّذِیْ لَا یُطْفَاُ \nFA-INNEE AS-ALOKA BENOORE WAJHEKAL LAZEE LAA YUTFA-O \nthen I ask You by the light of Your Face which is never extinguished, \nوَ بِوَجْہِ مُحَمَّدٍ حَبِیْبِكَ الْمُصْطَفٰی \nWA BEWAJHE MOHAMMADIN HABEEBEKAL MUSTAFAA\nby the face of Muhammad Your chosen beloved, \nوَ بِوَجْہِ وَلِیِّكَ عَلِیٍّ ۨ الْمُرْتَضٰی \nWA BEWAJHE WALIYYEKA A'LIYYENIL MURTAZAA \nby the face of Your friend Ali al-Murtaza, \nوَ بِحَقِّ اَوْلِیَآئِكَ الَّذِیْنَ انْتَجَبْتَهُمْ \nWA BEHAQQE AWLEYAAA-EKAL LAZEENAN TAJABTAHUM \nand by the right of Your chosen saints, \nاَنْ تُصَلِّیَ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nAN TOSALLEYA A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nthat You send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ اَنْ تَغْفِرَ لِیْ مَا مَضٰی مِنْ ذُنُوْبِیْ \nWA AN TAGHFERA LEE MAA MAZAA MIN ZONOOBEE \nforgive my past sins, \nوَ اَنْ تَعْصِمَنِیْ فِیْمَا بَقِیَ مِنْ عُمْرِیْ \nWA AN TA'SEMANEE FEEMAA BAQEYA MIN U'MREE \nprotect me during the remainder of my life, \nوَ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ اَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْ اَعُوْدَ فِیْ شَیْءٍ مِنْ مَعَاصِیْكَ اَبَدًا \nWA A-O'OZO BEKA ALLAAHUMMA AN A-OODA FEE SHAY-IN MIN MA-A'ASEEKA ABADAM \nand I seek refuge in You, O Allah, from ever returning to any disobedience to You \nمَّا اَبْقَیْتَنِیْ حَتّٰی تَتَوَفّٰنِیْ وَ اَنَا لَكَ مُطِیْعٌ \nMAA ABQAYTANEE HATTAA TATA-WAFFAAANEE WA ANAA LAKA MO-TEE-U'N \nas long as You keep me alive — until You cause me to die while I am obedient to You \nوَ اَنْتَ عَنِّیْ رَاضٍ وَ اَنْ تَخْتِمَ لِیْ عَمَلِیْ بِاَحْسَنِہٖ \nWA ANTA A'NNEE RAAZIN WA AN TAKHTEMA LEE A'MALEE BE-AHSANEHI \nand You are pleased with me. And that You conclude my deeds with the best of them, \nوَ تَجْعَلَ لِیْ ثَوَابَهُ الْجَنَّۃَ \nWA TAJ-A'LA LEE SAWAABAHUL JANNATA \nmake Paradise my reward, \nوَ اَنْ تَفْعَلَ بِیْ مَآ اَنْتَ اَهْلُہٗ یَا اَهْلَ التَّقْوٰی \nWA AN TAF-A'LA BEE MAAA ANTA AHLOHU YAA AHLAT TAQWAA \nand deal with me according to what befits You, O Lord of piety \nوَ یَا اَهْلَ الْمَغْفِرَۃِ وَ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nWA YAA AHLAL MAGHFERATE WA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nand Lord of forgiveness. And send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, \nوَ ارْحَمْنِیْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ یَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ.\nWAR HAMNEE BE-RAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA.\nand have mercy upon me by Your mercy, O Most Merciful of the merciful.”"
